  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Market Development Facility (MDF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Market Development&#xA0;Facility promotes&#xA0;higher incomes through a market systems approach; connecting individuals, businesses, governments and NGOs with each other, and with markets at home and abroad.
Market interventions are delivered in sectors such as high value agriculture, niche tourism, urban industries, aquaculture and livestock management.
MDF Pacific Expansion operates in Samoa, Tonga and Vanuatu.</narrative>
  </description>
